node_modules

# `dist/` is committed on purpose, unlike every other build output here. The
# package is installed straight from this repository, and the `prepare` script
# that would build it on the way in does not always get to run — npm now gates
# install scripts, and a host that blocks them installs a package with nothing
# in it. Committed, the clone already carries what it ships.
#
# So: `npm run build` before committing a change under `src/`.
demo-dist
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
